<Base title="Alissa Nicolet" current="home">
  <h1>Alissa Nicolet</h1>
  <p class="tagline">I build software that makes sustainability numbers auditable.</p>
  <p>
    LCA engineer turned product builder, based in the Netherlands. If you work on product
    footprinting, EPDs, or sustainability data infrastructure — this site is for you.
    Here you'll find case studies of tools I've built and where to reach me.
  </p>

  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <ul class="projects">
    <li>
      <a href="#">LCI·GRAPH</a>
      <p>
        Open-source pipeline that extracts life-cycle inventory data from academic papers
        into a queryable graph. <em>Case study in preparation.</em>
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#">GreenClaim</a>
      <p>
        LCA/EPD tooling built on the open-source Brightway framework, helping manufacturers
        selling into the EU turn methodology into defensible product numbers.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Writing</h2>
  <p>
    I write about sustainability, carbon accounting, and the systems around them on
    <a href="https://scop3.substack.com/">scop3</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
